        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo PP-8x12/2-1/8, Stainless Steel Scratch Guard for Door Levers</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis is a guard plate to protect the door from ADA Compliant Levers such as the <a href=\"/products/standard-commercial-leversets-global-gal-series\">Global GAL Series</a> or the <a href=\"/products/commercial-door-levers-standard-duty-grade-2-pdq-sd-series\"> PDQ SD Series</a>. It is 12 inches long and 8 inches with a 2-1/8 inch bore hole.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DJO-PP-8x12-sp-specifcations.gif?v=1704442281\" width=\"232\" height=\"271\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo PP-8x12/2-1/8 Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Door Lever Scratch Guard:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Stainless steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Hole Dimeter: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Horizontal Center of Hole is at 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Vertical Center of Hole is 6\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually. This item is custom made and therefore, NOT RETURNABLE.</i>\r\n</p>",
